---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About this blog and the game I'm building."
	pubDate={new Date()}
>
	<p>
		Hi — I'm a software engineer who decided to try something different: build an indie game.
		This blog is where I document that journey, from first prototype to (eventually) shipping
		something playable.
	</p>

	<p>The game is being built in <a href="https://godotengine.org/">Godot</a>. Expect posts on:</p>

	<ul>
		<li>Design decisions and the reasoning behind them</li>
		<li>Technical deep-dives on the parts I find interesting</li>
		<li>The boring engineering work that nobody talks about</li>
		<li>Mistakes, rewrites, and what I'd do differently</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		If any of that sounds interesting, the <a href="/blog">blog</a> is the place to start. New
		posts whenever there's something worth writing about.
	</p>
</Layout>
